、大型集成商政企组网安全项目经验优先；\n精通园区网、广域网、分支互联、边界防护、内网准入、老旧网络改造，熟悉等保 2.0 合规要求；\n具备竞品对标分析、行业洞察、方案 / 产品规划能力；优秀方案撰写、宣讲、政企客户沟通能力，可对接甲方中高层，挖掘业务痛点；\n懂AI安全解决方案的优先；持有 CISP、CISSP、HCIA/CCIE 等证书优先；\n接受全国短期出差。","ClassificationOne":"技术类","ClassificationTwo":"技术类","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-06T13:52:33","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"02bc22b7-bb6f-4e41-b474-a0e7d5b5c26c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390876947,"PostDateInt":1793585249000,"PostDate":"2026-11-02T10:07:29","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"AI存储解决方案工程师(J19093)","OrgId":700605060,"Org":"产研组","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市","浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"【岗位职责】\n1、负责AI存储解决方案规划、设计与落地，针对大模型训练和推理、Token工厂、政企Agent等场景，输出有竞争力的AI场景存储解决方案，包括技术趋势分析、需求调研、解决方案设计、市场项目支撑、生态合作等。\n2、结合AI行业技术趋势、大模型产业发展现状、存储技术迭代方向，梳理AI场景的存储痛点，持续优化解决方案竞争力，输出解决方案文档。\n3、跟踪行业竞品的AI存储方案、产品特性，结合公司产品优势，打造差异化AI存储解决方案，助力市场拓展和产品商业化落地。\n4、对接政企、运营商、互联网、金融、教育科研等客户，参与需求调研、场景分析、技术交流、方案输出等工作，联动产品、研发、销售、交付团队，推动项目落地和闭环。5、对接上下游生态合作，包括解决方案联合开发、商业模式合作、生态适配等。","Require":"【岗位要求】\n1、学历与专业：本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程、电子信息、大数据、人工智能等相关专业优先。\n2、工作经验：具备3年及以上存储或AI领域工作经验，有解决方案经验的优先。\n3、专业能力：熟悉分布式存储主流存储架构，了解存储协议、分布式架构、数据冗余、容灾备份、性能优化、AIops等关键技术；熟悉AI大模型训练、推理业务流程，了解GPU算力集群、算力调度、AI数据预处理、海量数据集等场景需求和基础设施架构。\n4、综合能力：具备良好的客户沟通、需求拆解、逻辑分析及文档撰写能力，能够独立完成需求调研、客户交流、方案输出和技术宣讲。\n5、素质要求：工作认真负责、主动性强，具备良好的团队协作意识，对AI和存储行业有浓厚兴趣，愿意持续深耕行业技术。","ClassificationOne":"其他","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-02T10:07:29","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"bd3cb1c0-1338-4a4d-8c9e-f2fe125a4277","Head